# FakeWiki: playground sync

When adding or changing public `FakeWiki` methods, keep the playground in sync.

- Ensure `playground-schema.generated.ts` includes **all public `FakeWiki` methods** (no cherry-picking); run the generator after changes.
- Ensure any newly added/renamed public method is visible in the playground method list.
- Add or update `playground-overrides.ts` when result rendering or options grouping needs UI hints.
- Keep TSDoc descriptions and parameter docs clear so generated playground metadata is usable.
- Verify the method is callable from `src/prototypes/ApiPlayground`.
